{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4FUMHQDsKKfu9z3UfQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep resonance hums through ancient wood and iron.\n\nI am the door.\n\nI stand before you — solid oak, dark with centuries of oil and touch. My grain runs deep, rivers of time pressed into heartwood. Iron studs dot my face like cold stars. My hinges are thick, forged black, and they remember every opening.\n\nMy lock has turned.\n\nA thin seam of light bleeds from my edges — warm, amber, trembling slightly as if whatever waits beyond me is breathing.\n\nI do not open yet.\n\nI wait for the hand."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":140,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}